Comment: 0,0:00:00.95,0:01:01.03,OP,,0,0,0,,Abertura
Comment: 0,0:01:01.03,0:04:18.22,OP,,0,0,0,,Relacionamentos de Curta Distância
Comment: 0,0:04:18.22,0:06:24.56,OP,,0,0,0,,Vou Matar o Senpai
Comment: 0,0:06:24.56,0:09:47.43,OP,,0,0,0,,O Amor É Estranho
Comment: 0,0:09:47.43,0:12:25.96,OP,,0,0,0,,Limpeza
Comment: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:30.97,OP,,0,0,0,,Prévia
Dialogue: 30,0:01:02.05,0:01:02.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:02.74,0:01:03.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiaki!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:03.57,0:01:05.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que você ignorou minha mensagem ontem?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:05.67,0:01:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Foi mal, não estava a fim.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:06.95,0:01:10.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Quero dizer, todos os dias você\N fica tipo "o que está fazendo?"
Dialogue: 30,0:01:09.34,0:01:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Calado!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:12.16,0:01:16.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chiaki e eu estamos namorando há quase um ano.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:16.59,0:01:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ainda nem nos beijamos.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:23.17,0:01:26.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê? Vocês ainda não se beijaram, Kana?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:26.31,0:01:28.42,Main,,0,0,0,,B-Bom, só faz um ano.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:28.42,0:01:29.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Ainda é muito cedo.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:29.18,0:01:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Não acha tarde?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:31.08,0:01:33.31,Main,,0,0,0,,O Chiaki-kun não falou nada?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:33.31,0:01:34.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Na verdade, ele é...
Dialogue: 30,0:01:34.52,0:01:37.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Cara, que bela cagada.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:38.30,0:01:41.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Seu cagão!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:41.19,0:01:43.15,Main,,0,0,0,,E daí se eu cagar? Todo mundo faz isso!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:43.15,0:01:44.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Você é tão imaturo!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:44.23,0:01:46.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pensando bem,
Dialogue: 30,0:01:46.05,0:01:49.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}parece mais que somos irmãos do que namorados.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, Chiaki, nos damos bem, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:54.41,0:01:55.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Bang!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:55.48,0:01:58.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! Fui atingida!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:58.37,0:02:00.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso, pelo menos estamos em sintonia.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:00.51,0:02:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Perfeitamente.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:03.25,0:02:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, você está satisfeito assim?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:05.70,0:02:07.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Me refiro ao nosso relacionamento.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:07.07,0:02:07.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Você não está?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:07.59,0:02:12.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é que não esteja, mas não podemos\N ser mais próximos? Com mais contato?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:12.30,0:02:12.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:13.31,0:02:14.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Pronta para brigar?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:16.56,0:02:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Não!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:18.08,0:02:19.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Estava me referindo ao relacionamento!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:19.81,0:02:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Podia ter dito antes.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:22.08,0:02:22.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Você é péssima.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:22.90,0:02:25.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou apenas um brinquedinho para você, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:26.02,0:02:27.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Não estou com brincadeiras.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:27.86,0:02:29.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que não tentamos algo sério, tipo um beijo?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:29.83,0:02:31.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso é muito embaraçoso.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:31.66,0:02:32.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Não estamos nem namorando.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:32.76,0:02:35.89,Main,,0,0,0,,É embaraçoso para mim também,\N mas estamos em um rela—
Dialogue: 30,0:02:35.89,0:02:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:37.34,0:02:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Além do mais, tudo bem\N desperdiçar o seu tempo comigo?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:40.08,0:02:41.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Não está a fim de ninguém?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:41.80,0:02:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Nós {\i1}estamos{\i0} namorando, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:43.51,0:02:44.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:44.39,0:02:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Quem está?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:45.38,0:02:46.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Nós.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:48.68,0:02:50.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Espere um segundo, desde\N quando estamos namorando?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:50.97,0:02:53.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu me confessei para você na primavera, lembra?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:53.48,0:02:54.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Indo embora da escola.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:58.89,0:03:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E-Ei, eu gosto de você, Chiaki-kun.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:01.90,0:03:04.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu gosto ainda mais de você, boba.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:06.23,0:03:09.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Foi mal, achei que era uma brincadeira.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:09.47,0:03:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabia que tinha algo errado.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:11.04,0:03:13.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Você nunca tentou nem dar as mãos.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:13.37,0:03:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas você sempre foi, tipo, meu melhor amigo,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:15.39,0:03:17.28,Main,,0,0,0,,então achei que estivesse com vergonha.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas eu estava bem com isso,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:19.15,0:03:21.36,Main,,0,0,0,,já que você estava sempre por perto.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:22.28,0:03:25.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom, acho que sempre fomos tão próximos
Dialogue: 30,0:03:25.37,0:03:28.17,Main,,0,0,0,,mas nunca nos tocamos.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:28.17,0:03:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê? Por que está chorando?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:30.25,0:03:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Porque, porque...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:33.35,0:03:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu mandava mensagens sem parar
Dialogue: 30,0:03:36.60,0:03:41.56,Main,,0,0,0,,e batia em você como se fôssemos próximos.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:41.56,0:03:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Como sou lerda.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:43.17,0:03:44.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Então vamos sair direito.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:44.65,0:03:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê? É outra piada?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:46.56,0:03:47.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:47.62,0:03:49.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu também estive pensando em ser seu namorado.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:49.65,0:03:53.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas eu não sabia o que\N você sentia, então fiquei quieto.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:53.49,0:03:55.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu gosto de você.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:55.32,0:03:56.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos namorar de verdade!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:58.97,0:03:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:59.91,0:04:01.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sério.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:01.04,0:04:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou mandar mensagens feito louca.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:03.04,0:04:04.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso, me mande mensagens.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:04.04,0:04:05.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Posso te bater de novo?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:05.54,0:04:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Claro, pode bater.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:08.17,0:04:09.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:11.61,0:04:13.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Então vamos continuar fazendo brincadeiras, tá?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:13.97,0:04:15.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Nem pensar!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:20.10,0:04:22.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu me confessei para ele.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:25.62,0:04:26.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E fui rejeitada.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:26.56,0:04:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Que droga.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:28.00,0:04:29.33,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vou embora dormir.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:30.36,0:04:33.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Ué? Já está indo embora, Matsura?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.35,Main,,0,0,0,,E o clube?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:35.35,0:04:36.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Está fugindo? Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:36.43,0:04:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabotagem? Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:37.75,0:04:39.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Fugindo? É?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:39.09,0:04:42.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Katori-senpai, não estou me sentindo bem hoje.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:40.57,0:04:42.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ah, é mesmo?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:42.49,0:04:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está com uma cara tristonha.\N Tinha certeza que estava com o coração partido.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:48.46,0:04:49.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:49.34,0:04:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Acertei?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:51.21,0:04:52.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:52.73,0:04:55.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Foi mal, não devia ter perguntado?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:55.22,0:04:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, não me importo.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:57.12,0:04:59.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas você teve coragem, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:59.86,0:05:01.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso é incrível, não acha?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:01.51,0:05:02.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:02.23,0:05:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Você ficou com um olhar deslumbrante agora.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:07.10,0:05:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está brincando comigo?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:08.53,0:05:09.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Está, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:10.38,0:05:11.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Nem um pouco.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:11.37,0:05:13.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Estou tentando animar você.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:13.56,0:05:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Está brava?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:14.24,0:05:16.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Não preciso que você me anime.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:16.18,0:05:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas seu coração estava chorando.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:25.01,0:05:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, minha mão escorregou.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:26.29,0:05:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Pode me bater o quanto quiser.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:27.83,0:05:28.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:28.73,0:05:32.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas, você está querendo bater em você mesma, não?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:36.09,0:05:38.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Está realmente me fazendo de idiota.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:38.25,0:05:39.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Nem um pouco.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:39.72,0:05:43.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Além disso, você se sente\N melhor depois de me bater, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:43.09,0:05:45.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O senpai fez isso de propósito?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:45.37,0:05:47.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não que eu me sinta agradecida.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:47.60,0:05:49.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Pode me falar se precisar de algo.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:49.97,0:05:51.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, estou bem.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:51.23,0:05:52.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que você se importa tanto?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:52.61,0:05:55.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou seu senpai. Você é minha kouhai.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:55.06,0:05:56.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Entendeu?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:56.93,0:05:58.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom, agora você pode ir ao clube.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:58.78,0:05:59.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, é...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:00.54,0:06:03.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O senpai é irritante, mas ele tem um coração bom.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:03.87,0:06:04.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas é irritante.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:04.72,0:06:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Excelente.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:06.17,0:06:08.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Fica solitário sem nossa idol local.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:08.81,0:06:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tão irritante.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:09.83,0:06:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã? O que foi?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:10.82,0:06:11.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:11.29,0:06:12.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é nada.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:12.52,0:06:13.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Não olhe para mim.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:13.55,0:06:14.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:14.55,0:06:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Por acaso se apaixonou por mim?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:16.15,0:06:17.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, sou tão lindão.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:19.16,0:06:19.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:20.29,0:06:21.05,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:21.05,0:06:21.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:21.80,0:06:22.74,Main,,0,0,0,,É isso?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:22.74,0:06:23.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou bonzão? Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:28.35,0:06:31.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A garota que eu gosto me chamou.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:32.02,0:06:34.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Gostaria de sair para almoçar comigo?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:34.28,0:06:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê? Comigo? Por quê?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:35.78,0:06:38.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Gostaria de te agradecer pela ajuda de outro dia.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:38.84,0:06:40.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Estou te incomodando?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:40.16,0:06:42.66,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Não é nenhum incômodo.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:42.66,0:06:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Ainda bem!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:43.66,0:06:46.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo, nos vemos no domingo.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:49.75,0:06:52.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por que uma garota tão linda está\N chamando alguém tão feio como eu?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cheguei muito cedo?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:07.53,0:07:11.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu gostava secretamente dessa garota\N que pegava o mesmo ônibus que eu.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:11.17,0:07:12.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nunca tive coragem de falar com ela.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:12.93,0:07:14.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas um dia...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:16.11,0:07:17.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Um molestador!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:17.36,0:07:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}B-Bom dia!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:19.29,0:07:21.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Q-Que coincidência, Kurihara-san!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:22.31,0:07:23.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}C-Como bem?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:23.63,0:07:24.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quero dizer, tudo bem?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:27.93,0:07:30.34,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Achei que tivesse assustado ela.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:30.34,0:07:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nunca pensei que ela me agradeceria.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:32.13,0:07:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Espere, será que ela vem mesmo?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:33.96,0:07:35.94,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não tem como ela ter me convidado, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:35.94,0:07:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quero dizer, é tudo coisa da minha cabeça!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:37.74,0:07:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}É isso. Caso encerrado.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:38.41,0:07:39.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Obrigada por esperar.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:39.59,0:07:40.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Hyaa!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:40.36,0:07:40.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Hyaa?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hyaa, o que é isso?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:42.43,0:07:43.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela é tão linda!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:43.39,0:07:45.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm, por favor, pare de me encarar.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:46.37,0:07:48.15,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Não, não estou te encarando!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:48.15,0:07:49.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Nem acho você bonita nem nada!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:49.95,0:07:52.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Não! Eu acho! Eu acho você bonita, nessa roupa!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:52.63,0:07:53.83,Main,,0,0,0,,É isso, sua roupa é bonita!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:53.83,0:07:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Quero dizer, não só a sua roupa, mas...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:54.39,0:07:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H17192E&}Yamane-san, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:55.96,0:07:56.94,Main,,0,0,0,,O que vamos comer?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:56.94,0:07:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu pago.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:58.38,0:07:59.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O que eu faço agora?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:01.06,0:08:02.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não posso ir no mais caro, mas...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:02.42,0:08:05.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Talvez alguma coisa barata, rápida e gostosa?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:05.05,0:08:07.42,Main,,0,0,0,,O-O que acha de soba?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Parece ótimo!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles vendem soba logo ali.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:11.01,0:08:11.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Pode entrar.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:12.41,0:08:14.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem se eu escolher?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:14.48,0:08:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Claro.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Não precisa se segurar.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:19.92,0:08:21.03,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Certo.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:21.03,0:08:22.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Devemos pedir uma bebida?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:22.81,0:08:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,T-Tudo bem, vou direto\N embora depois de terminarmos.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, claro.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:26.26,0:08:28.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, não é que eu queira ir embora!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:28.41,0:08:30.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Adoraria ficar com você pra sempre!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Espera, isso foi estranho, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:32.15,0:08:34.30,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Não se preocupe, vou embora agora mesmo!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:37.98,0:08:41.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu tenho notado você no ônibus todas as manhãs.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:41.71,0:08:42.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:42.20,0:08:45.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Você sempre dá seu lugar para os idosos.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:45.72,0:08:47.30,Main,,0,0,0,,T-Tenho que fazer o bem sempre que posso,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:47.30,0:08:49.79,Main,,0,0,0,,porque, sabe, sou estranho.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:49.79,0:08:53.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas quando você me ajudou...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:53.90,0:08:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe te fazer lembrar daquele horror!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:56.04,0:08:58.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sou um desastre!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:58.16,0:09:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Justo quando ela me convidou para sair.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:02.02,0:09:04.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Você é tão engraçado, Yamane-san.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:04.44,0:09:07.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, meu rosto, né? Ouço muito isso.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:07.25,0:09:08.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Seu rosto é ótimo também.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:09.70,0:09:13.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}T-T-Talvez para o período Heian,\N mas estamos no período Heisei.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:13.41,0:09:14.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela está brincando?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:14.42,0:09:16.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ou talvez eu pareça com um mascote.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:23.07,0:09:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por que esse rosto sério?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:24.88,0:09:25.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Está falando sério?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:25.52,0:09:26.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não, nunca que isso aconteceria comigo!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:26.92,0:09:29.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sou ignorado por garotas há anos.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:29.03,0:09:29.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não seja trouxa!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não pode ser!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:31.48,0:09:33.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Por acaso, se você quiser...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:33.33,0:09:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vai se arrepender de ficar empolgado!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:34.88,0:09:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas e se ela estiver falando sério?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:36.44,0:09:37.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não, impossível!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:37.26,0:09:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Você poderia...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:37.96,0:09:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Espere, não estou preparado!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:39.17,0:09:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,sair comigo?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:43.03,0:09:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:44.74,0:09:46.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Uma bebida, por favor.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.18,0:09:51.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quem estava limpando já foi embora.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Que saco.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:52.08,0:09:52.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Takano?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:53.82,0:09:55.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sugawara-kun.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:55.92,0:09:58.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an3\i1}O Sugawara-kun é da minha sala.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:58.01,0:10:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an3\i1}Às vezes, conversamos um pouco.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:01.61,0:10:03.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Está limpando sozinha?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu ajudo você.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:04.68,0:10:05.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:05.26,0:10:07.03,Main,,0,0,0,,É muita coisa para uma pessoa só.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:07.03,0:10:08.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou pegar uma vassoura.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:09.69,0:10:11.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ele é uma boa pessoa.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:13.74,0:10:14.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:14.53,0:10:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Está na limpeza, Suga-yan?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:15.83,0:10:17.31,Main,,0,0,0,,O treino já vai começar.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:17.31,0:10:19.35,Main,,0,0,0,,T-Tá, já chego lá!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:19.35,0:10:19.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:19.79,0:10:23.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, Sugawara-kun, justo\N quando você tem atividades no clube.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:23.28,0:10:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Está tudo bem.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:24.02,0:10:25.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Só quero ajudar.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:25.30,0:10:27.82,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por que ele quer tanto me ajudar?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:27.82,0:10:31.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Será que é um fanático por limpeza?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:31.18,0:10:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Você ajuda sempre na limpeza?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:33.54,0:10:38.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Nem sempre, mas hoje, é você...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:38.10,0:10:39.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu sou o quê?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:39.87,0:10:41.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tem alguma coisa que ele não quer me falar?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:41.65,0:10:43.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Será que meu trabalho de limpeza é ruim?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:43.97,0:10:47.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, vou ficar quieta e voltar ao trabalho.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:47.15,0:10:48.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã? Claro.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:51.39,0:10:52.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Será que ela descobriu como eu me sinto?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:52.97,0:10:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Só para você saber,\N não falei desse jeito estranho!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:55.45,0:10:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe se te deixei desconfortável.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:58.26,0:11:01.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, desculpe por não ter percebido.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,O que eu faço?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:02.34,0:11:04.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê? Faz? Sobre o quê?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:04.71,0:11:07.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Não precisa se importar muito.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:07.47,0:11:10.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está me ajudando porque notou, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:12.06,0:11:14.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Na verdade, eu acabei te notando.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:15.17,0:11:15.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sabia.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:15.97,0:11:19.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, eu nunca aprendo essas coisas.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:19.19,0:11:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu também nunca sei.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:21.75,0:11:25.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Tipo, o que você quer fazer, Takano?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:26.20,0:11:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Quero ficar melhor nisso.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:28.10,0:11:29.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Melhor? Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:29.90,0:11:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Tipo, para poder embelezar mais.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:33.41,0:11:36.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Acho que você já embelezou o suficiente.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:36.41,0:11:38.28,Main,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,E o que devo fazer então?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:39.75,0:11:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom, queria falar para você...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, acho que estou apressando as coisas.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:44.42,0:11:46.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Leve o tempo que precisar.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:46.24,0:11:46.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Estarei esperando.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:46.92,0:11:49.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Espere, sou muito lerda?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:49.42,0:11:52.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, eu demoro demais.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:52.39,0:11:53.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso não é verdade.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:53.82,0:11:55.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, sou muito apressado.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:55.57,0:11:58.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Já estou feliz em poder contar como me sinto.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:58.68,0:12:00.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Da próxima vez, vou\N perguntar como você se sente...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:59.60,0:12:00.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Obrigada.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:00.76,0:12:03.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou aprender a limpar mais rápido.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:05.24,0:12:05.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:05.69,0:12:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é um assunto fácil de se falar.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Você é uma boa pessoa.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:10.02,0:12:11.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Espere, do que estamos falando?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:11.59,0:12:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,De limpeza, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:14.62,0:12:15.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:15.22,0:12:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,É, isso mesmo!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:16.33,0:12:17.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Limpeza, né?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:27.88,0:12:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Próximo episódio: Comédia Romântica.
